---
/**
 * Coaching page: “Our Coaching Expertise” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-3095393 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="3095393"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-4d8b7d5 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
      data-id="4d8b7d5"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="heading.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container"><h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Our Coaching Expertise</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-8e20389 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
      data-id="8e20389"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container"><p>Customised Coaching Solutions for Tangible, Time-bound Outcomes</p></div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-acee43f vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
      data-id="acee43f"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <p>
          We recognise that every leadership journey is unique, and therefore our coaching specialisations are designed
          to address diverse business and individual challenges with precision and purpose. Whether you’re driving
          strategic change, building high-performance teams, or elevating individual leadership, our engagements are
          aligned to deliver meaningful experiential impact.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-ec4fa05 e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child"
      data-id="ec4fa05"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
